    <div class="margin-page">
      <div class="container-app">
        <section class="aqua-crete-section">
          <div class="aqua-crete-section__head">
            <h2>Aqua-Crete Concept</h2>
            <p>
              Aqua-Crete blends a 100% inorganic, non-combustible ceramic binder
              powder with a water-based liquid, allowing direct placement on
              saturated concrete (100% moisture) and foot traffic after roughly
              one hour. Strong adhesion, high compressive strength, and a
              GORE-TEX®-style breathable waterproof function protect the base,
              while the odor-free, non-toxic chemistry delivers ultra-fast cure
              as an eco-friendly inorganic ceramic waterproof floor topping.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="aqua-crete-figure">
            <figure>
              <img
                src="/images/aqua-crete-layer.jpg"
                alt="Cross-section showing Aqua-Crete layers from concrete base to polished top"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <figcaption>Layer structure from concrete substrate to polished
                finish</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>

          <div class="aqua-crete-highlight">
            <div>
              <h3>Layer Structure</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Polishing &amp; sealer application</strong>
                  – Glassy coating that suppresses bacterial growth and blocks
                  contaminant penetration.</li>
                <li><strong>Water-based inorganic Aqua-Crete layer</strong>
                  – Ceramic mortar layer with channels for moisture discharge.</li>
                <li><strong>Moisture-conditioned base</strong>
                  – Allows vapor diffusion while blocking reverse moisture.</li>
                <li><strong>Cement laitance &amp; plain concrete</strong>
                  – Crack filler and primer reinforce the bond to the base slab.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Application Benefits</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Non-combustible inorganic makeup minimizes fire risk and
                  pairs well with high-temperature sterilization.</li>
                <li>Low dust and particulates support food/pharma HACCP hygiene
                  standards.</li>
                <li>Strong bond to the substrate prevents lifting or
                  delamination over long service periods.</li>
                <li>High-gloss polish after finishing shortens cleaning and
                  hygiene inspection time.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="aqua-crete-section">
